the ruler","original_source_inspected":true}],"verification_rationale":"The figures are in the royal edict; the original wording already distinguishes an inscriptional report from audited casualties.","original_source_inspected":true,"material_limitation":"The casualties may be rhetorical or approximate.","removal_reason":null,"applied_to_isolated_database":true}'::jsonb);
