mission.","original_source_inspected":true,"material_limitation":"Ancient dialogue or doctrine is classified as textual assertion or traditional narrative. The translation alone does not independently establish the narrated event as history.","removal_reason":null,"applied_to_isolated_database":true}'::jsonb);
